{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>&quot;The sins I have committed are eating at me.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/2e4abcdffd6dff705dd4f7aceb8e6515.avif?t=1773489657\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras_big/2e4abcdffd6dff705dd4f7aceb8e6515.avif?t=1773489657 width=1560 height=366 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENTWINE is a slow, suffocating descent into the abstract; a rich narrative, meticulously detailed environments, unsettling creatures, intricate puzzles, and slow-burn psychological horror inspired by the genre\u2019s most enduring classics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Lucas Hale, a retired police officer marked by the life in which he tried so desperately to escape. Hardened, he is forced to confront the estate: his own choices, his own failures, and what they have left in their wake.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/15243b3ad1e229884953ab8f07080b7d.avif?t=1773489657\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are defenceless; left with no traditional weapons, bar the environment, and few items you have to maintain your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Solve interconnected puzzles and navigate the forest, abandoned house, underground facility, police station, and more. Piece together the fractured story of Lucas Hale as you delve deeper into the estate, where something, ever-lurking, draws near. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/757c0f8109165eaef87e3acdada0805c.avif?t=1773489657\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras_big/757c0f8109165eaef87e3acdada0805c.avif?t=1773489657 width=1560 height=608 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breathtaking visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality, binaural sound powered by Steam Audio.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A terrifyingly heavy and fresh take on psychological horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied locations. Explore a forest, abandoned house, police station and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure isolation - no distracting NPCS or gimmicks. Just you and it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavy focus on narrative. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging and intricate puzzles - Inspired by Silent Hill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Native controller / gamepad support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/de10ced06213330cd4630afb05df8eb0.poster.avif?t=1773489657\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/de10ced06213330cd4630afb05df8eb0.webm?t=1773489657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/de10ced06213330cd4630afb05df8eb0.mp4?t=1773489657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3108570?t=1773489657","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3108570?t=1773489657","capsul