m/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/15243b3ad1e229884953ab8f07080b7d.avif?t=1773489657\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are defenceless; left with no traditional weapons, bar the environment, and few items you have to maintain your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Solve interconnected puzzles and navigate the forest, abandoned house, underground facility, police station, and more. Piece together the fractured story of Lucas Hale as you delve deeper into the estate, where something, ever-lurking, draws near. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras/757c0f8109165eaef87e3acdada0805c.avif?t=1773489657\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108570/extras_big/757c0f8109165eaef87e3acdada0805c.avif?t=1773489657 width=1560 height=608 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breathtaking visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality, binaural sound powered by Steam Audio.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A terrifyingly heavy and fresh take on psychological horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied locations. Explore a forest, abandoned house, police station and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure isolation - no distracting NPCS or gimmicks. Just you and it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavy focus on narrative. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging and intricate puzzles - Inspired by Silent Hill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Native controller / gamepad support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=